#. そ、そんな…ッ！！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-You...!"
msgstr ""

#. ヒ、ヒデーべ…！
#. 鉄塊に…なっちまった…！
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"You suck, man! You turned him into a mangled hunk of\n"
"junk!"
msgstr ""

#. ふぅ、働いた働いた！
#. 腹減ったからラーメンでも食おうかな！
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Whew, that really took it outta me! Maybe I'll go\n"
"grill up a plate of chicken!"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱガテン飯と言ったら、ラーメンだよね！
#. ちなみに、ボクは塩ラーメン至上主義者なんだ！
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"After all, they say for post-workout grub, chicken's\n"
"where it's at! And I'm all about the grilled goodness!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、とんこつとか味噌とかバカっぽいじゃん。
#. 色とか匂いとかボリュームとかさぁ！！
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Fried? Broiled? Gimme a break! The color, the smell,\n"
"the succulence... Grilled is where it's at!"
msgstr ""

#. アッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0006 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahh-hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. 危険なのはわかってるよ…
msgctxt "0007 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "I realize how dangerous it could be."
msgstr ""

#. それでも、やらなくちゃいけないんだ。
msgctxt "0008 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "But still...I have to do this."
msgstr ""

#. 怖いけど…でも大丈夫…
msgctxt "0009 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "I'm scared, but...I can handle it."
msgstr ""

#. なんか…よくわかんないんだけど…
msgctxt "0010 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "I...don't really understand why, but..."
msgstr ""

#. みんなの事を思うと、勇気がわいてくるんだ！
msgctxt "0011 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"When I think about everyone else, my courage starts to\n"
"grow...!"
msgstr ""

#. 人工知能が何を言ってんだって思うかもしれないけど、
#. でも本当なんだよ！
msgctxt "0012 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"You might think I'm just some inhuman AI, but it's\n"
"true!"
msgstr ""

#. だから…大丈夫なんだ。
msgctxt "0013 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "So...it's okay."
msgstr ""

#. みんなの為なら怖くないんだ！！
msgctxt "0014 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"If it's for the sake of everyone else, I won't be\n"
"afraid!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>フラッシュバックするアルターエゴの言葉が、
#. ボクの心の奥底で、怒りに変わっていく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Alter Ego's words raced through my heart and soul, and\n"
"my disbelief gave way to raw anger.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒くドロドロに煮詰められたような怒り…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The anger turned to fury, black and muddy and boiling\n"
"over...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは言葉となって、
#. ボクの口からあふれ出た！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It bubbled up through my body, quickly overflowing and\n"
"shooting out of my mouth...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よ、よくも…ボクらの仲間を…ッ！
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "How dare you...? That was my friend!"
msgstr ""

#. よくも殺したなッ！！
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "How dare you kill him!?"
msgstr ""

#. おろ？　パソコンと友達なの！？
#. イタくね？　ボールと友達って以上にイタくね？
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Huh? You were friends with a laptop? That's pretty\n"
"pathetic. What's next, friends with a basketball!?"
msgstr ""

#. …うるさいッ！！
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Shut the hell up!"
msgstr ""

#. ただのパソコンなんかじゃない…
#. アルターエゴは仲間だったんだ…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He wasn't just a laptop. He was my friend!"
msgstr ""

#. お前はそれを殺したんだッ！！
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And you killed him!"
msgstr ""

#. すべてのものに霊魂が宿る的な精霊信仰って事？
#. アニミズム的発想？
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Is this what you call animism? Where a soul dwells\n"
"within all things? Even, like...laptops?"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ…なんでもいいけどさ…
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Well, you can call it whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#. ていうか、目障りだったんだよね。
#. 勝手に余計な事まで調べようとしてるしさ…
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Bottom line is, it got in my way. It was trying to\n"
"find things out all sneaky sneaky."
msgstr ""

#. やはり…気付いたのね…
msgctxt "0027 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So...you finally noticed him."
msgstr ""

#. いやいや、ボクは最初から気付いてたよ！
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Finally? No no no, I knew about it from the very\n"
"beginning!"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲クンがノートパソコンに何かしてた事も、
#. お前らが、それを使ってデータを解析してた事も…
msgctxt "0029 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I knew Chihiro was doing something with the laptop.\n"
"And I knew you were using it to analyze data."
msgstr ""

#. 最初っから、なにもかもお見通しですがな！
msgctxt "0030 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I knew exactly how it was all gonna play out from the\n"
"start!"
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 知ってて、あえて泳がせていたのか…！
msgctxt "0032 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You knew, and you were still cocky enough to let us\n"
"take the plunge...?"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、そのノートパソコンに入ってたデータって、
#. 言うなれば、ボクからのプレゼントだった訳よ。
msgctxt "0033 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean...the data in that laptop? It was...I\n"
"guess you could call it a gift, from me to you."
msgstr ""

#. あの難解なロックを解除出来た場合のみ手に入る、
#. ご褒美的な情報だった訳なのよ！
msgctxt "0034 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Or maybe more like a reward, in honor of you being\n"
"able to unlock something so difficult."
msgstr ""

#. だからさ、それを調べる事自体には、
#. 問題なかったんだけど…
msgctxt "0035 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So of course I didn't care if you got access to that."
msgstr ""

#. ネットワークまで覗きに来るのは調子に乗り過ぎ！
#. なので、処分させていただきました～！！
msgctxt "0036 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But sneaking into the network was just too personal!\n"
"So I had to do a little, ya know, reformatting!"
msgstr ""

#. 僕もみんなの役に立ちたいんだよ…
msgctxt "0037 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "I want to keep being helpful to everyone."
msgstr ""

#. みんながここから出られるように、
#. 僕もみんなと一緒に頑張りたいんだよ！
msgctxt "0038 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"I want to work as hard as everyone else so that we can\n"
"all get out of here!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アルターエゴは…ボクらの為に戦おうとした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Alter Ego wanted to fight for us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>命がけで戦おうとした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He wanted to help, at the risk of his own life...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして…殺された……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And for that...he was killed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ、おしおきタイムのお陰で、
#. いくぶんすっきりしましたぞよ！
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... Yeah, the punishment time has made me feel a\n"
"billion times better!"
msgstr ""

#. 無意味な死を見ると、なんだか元気出るよね！
#. 下には下がいると思えるしさ！
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Experiencing a meaningless death is so soothing! It\n"
"makes me remember that every low can get even lower!"
msgstr ""

#. 違う…無意味な死なんかじゃない…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No...his death wasn't meaningless, either."
msgstr ""

#. みんなの死が…仲間の死が…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Everybody who's died so far... The deaths of each and\n"
"every one of our friends..."
msgstr ""

#. ボク達を強くしてくれるんだ…！！
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "They all make us stronger!"
msgstr ""

#. いつか絶対！　思い知らせてやるっ！！
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I swear to God...someday, you WILL pay for this!"
msgstr ""

#. うわっ、メチャ怒ってますやん。
#. ムチャ怖いですやん。
msgctxt "0048 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Holy moly! You're super mad! Like, just unreasonably\n"
"upset!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、そろそろ退散…
#. でも、その前にッ！
msgctxt "0049 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay, time to bring things to a close! Oh, but before\n"
"that—!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>続き<CLT>を読んでおかないとね！
msgctxt "0050 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I need to read the <CLT 3>post script<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 続き…？
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Post script...?"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんの遺書が、
#. まだ終わってないんだよね。
msgctxt "0052 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Yeah, there's still a bit more left of Sakura's note."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ、気になるみたいですな。
#. じゃあ読んであげるよ…
msgctxt "0054 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... Do I have your attention? Okay then, here we\n"
"go..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクの美声でねッ！！
msgctxt "0055 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Prepare your ears for the dulcet tones of yours truly!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>…朝日奈よ、最後に
#. 仲間のみんなに伝えて欲しい事がある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>...One other thing, Hina. There's something I'd like\n"
"you to tell the others.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おそらく、この学園の謎を解く手がかりとなるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hopefully it will act as a clue to help you unravel\n"
"the mystery of this school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え…？　手掛かり…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What? A clue...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 内通者として幾度どなく黒幕とやり取りした結果、
#. 我は、ある事実を知るに至ったのだ。
msgctxt "0059 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I've spoken with the mastermind off and on the whole\n"
"time I've been here, and so I've learned one thing..."
msgstr ""

#. その事実とは…
msgctxt "0060 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Which is..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は我らの体に<CLT 3>“ある事”<CLT>をしている。
msgctxt "0061 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "...the mastermind has <CLT 3>done something<CLT> to us."
msgstr ""

#. その“ある事”とは、おそらく……
msgctxt "0062 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I think what they've done is—"
msgstr ""

#. おっと、危ない危ない！！
#. これ以上はネタバレが過ぎますって！！
msgctxt "0063 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Oopsie daisy! That was a close one! Another word and\n"
"we would've been hip deep in spoiler territory!"
msgstr ""

#. という訳で読書会は終了でーす！！
msgctxt "0064 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay, I don't wanna ruin the surprise, so book club is\n"
"dismissed for today!"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ！？　こんな中途半端なところで！？
msgctxt "0065 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What!? You can't just stop at the most important bit!"
msgstr ""

#. …気になるでしょう？
#. この歯切れの悪さに、腹が立つでしょう？
msgctxt "0066 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It makes your brain rumble and tumble, huh? It makes\n"
"you so mad you don't even friggin' know, huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. それが目的だよ、バーカ！
#. オマエラが、妙な結束固めやがる仕返しだもんねーッ！
msgctxt "0067 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's the whole point, STUPID! It's to get back at\n"
"all of you for hardening your resolve!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…せめて…
#. さくらちゃんの遺書を…
msgctxt "0068 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Fine, but at least...Sakura's note..."
msgstr ""

#. …あげる訳ねーだろ！
msgctxt "0069 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Like I'd ever let any of you greaseballs have it!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな……
msgctxt "0070 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "B-But..."
msgstr ""

#. へっへっへ…残念でしたね…！
msgctxt "0071 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Heh-heh-heh. Sucks for you, loser!"
msgstr ""

#. …って、あれ？　何だこれ？
msgctxt "0072 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...Wait, what's this?"
msgstr ""

#. 今度はなんなの…？
msgctxt "0073 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What is it now...?"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…遺書の最後の文章が…
msgctxt "0074 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "There's one last line in the note!"
msgstr ""

#. 最後に、黒幕に言っておくがいい…
msgctxt "0075 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "And let me just say this to the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. 我は、ただでは死なん。
msgctxt "0076 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I'm not going to just lay down and die."
msgstr ""

#. 必ずや貴様に<CLT 3>一矢報いる<CLT>…とな。
msgctxt "0077 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I *will* <CLT 3>fight you<CLT>, you bastard. No matter what.\n"
"...And that's seriously it!"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだよ、これ？
#. 負け惜しみ…だよね？
msgctxt "0078 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Huh. Wow, what a stubborn loser, huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただでは死なない？　一矢報いる？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She won't lay down and die? She'll fight you...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …まぁ、いいや。
#. 死んだ人間の事を気にしても仕方がないし。
msgctxt "0080 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever. Who cares what some dead musclehead\n"
"has to say?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、ボクはそろそろ失礼するけどさ…
msgctxt "0081 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Okay, I'm outta here!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラも一晩ゆっくり休んで…
msgctxt "0082 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You guys should try to get some rest, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. この学園生活への取り組み方を
#. 考え直した方がいいと思うよ？
msgctxt "0083 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And maybe take some time to reconsider how you\n"
"approach this school life of yours..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に卒業しなくていいの…？
#. 外の世界の未練を本当に断ち切れるの…？
msgctxt "0084 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you don't want to graduate? Can you\n"
"really cut free from the regrets of the outside world?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…よく考えるんですね…
msgctxt "0085 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... Think about that. Think long, think hard..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな言葉だけを残し、
#. モノクマはボクらの前から去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Those were his parting words to us, before\n"
"disappearing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…一体なんだったんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But what was that all about...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんが最後に残した言葉…
#. この学園の謎を解く手掛かりになるって言葉…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura's final message, her last clue to help us solve\n"
"the mystery of this school...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕が…ボクらの体に<CLT><CLT 3>“何か”<CLT><CLT 4>をしている…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind...<CLT><CLT 3>did something<CLT><CLT 4> to us?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>前に、霧切さんも、
#. それと同じような事を言ってたような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko said something like that before, didn't she?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれは…セレスさんの学級裁判が終わった後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was after Celeste's trial was over...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あなたは…何をしたの…？
msgctxt "0092 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What did you do?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたは、私の体に何をしたの？
msgctxt "0093 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What did you do...to my body?"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ！？
msgctxt "0094 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...What!?"
msgstr "...Cái gì!?"

#. 答えて…あなたは私の体に何をしたの？
msgctxt "0095 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Answer me. What did you do to my body?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕が…何かをした…
#. ボク達の体に……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind did something...to our bodies...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何をしたって言うんだよ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What are they saying the mastermind did...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは…何をされたって言うんだよ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What did the mastermind do to us?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>例えば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクら全員の体の中には、
#. 小型爆弾のような物が埋め込まれていて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did the mastermind plant a bomb in us or something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学園から出て行こうとすると、
#. その小型爆弾がセンサーに反応して…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And if we try to leave the school, a sensor goes\n"
"off...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…爆発する！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and the bomb explodes!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>映画やマンガで見た事のあるシチュエーションだ。
#. ない話じゃ…ないような……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I've seen stuff like that in movies and comics and\n"
"stuff. So it's not totally unheard of...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…！　そんなのって考えただけでも最悪だ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No...! I feel awful just thinking about it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やめよう…そんな最悪な事を考えるのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't afford to acknowledge thoughts like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …とりあえず、これで学級裁判も終わったし、
#. モノクマも去ってったし…
msgctxt "0106 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So the class trial is over and Monokuma's gone..."
msgstr ""

#. …そんで、これからどーすんべ？
msgctxt "0107 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So...now what do we do?"
msgstr ""

#. 上に帰る以外に何があるんだ？
msgctxt "0108 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What else is there, other than to head back up?"
msgstr ""

#. そーだな！　そんじゃ帰るとすっか！
msgctxt "0109 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh, yeah! Okay, let's get out of here."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも……
msgctxt "0110 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "B-But..."
msgstr ""

#. あの…私は……
msgctxt "0111 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I, um..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0112 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さん…
#. やっぱり、責任を感じて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina must still feel responsible...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. フン…バカバカしい。
#. 自惚れるのもいい加減にしろ…
msgctxt "0114 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hmph. Dial back that ego a bit, girl."
msgstr ""

#. お前のような間抜けが仕掛けた謎など、
#. 大した事ではない…
msgctxt "0115 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The kind of mystery someone like you could pose is\n"
"absolutely no threat."
msgstr ""

#. あの程度の事で、俺が殺される訳ないだろう…
msgctxt "0116 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I would never have lost to that kind of challenge."
msgstr ""

#. よく言うべ…霧切っちと苗木っちのお陰だったべ？
msgctxt "0117 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about? Kyoko and Makoto are the\n"
"ones that figured everything out."
msgstr ""

#. 黙れ…
msgctxt "0118 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Shut up..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0119 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 本当に…ごめんなさい……
msgctxt "0120 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Seriously...I'm sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. いつまで謝っているつもりだ…
#. それで最後にしろ…
msgctxt "0121 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"How many times do you plan to apologize? How about you\n"
"make that the last one."
msgstr ""

#. お前に何度も謝罪されるほど、
#. 俺は落ちぶれていない…
msgctxt "0122 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I haven't reached a point where I need someone\n"
"apologizing to me more than once..."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…わかったよ…
msgctxt "0123 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "O-Okay, I see what you mean..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、じゃあ…
msgctxt "0124 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Th-Then..."
msgstr ""

#. そう…するね……
msgctxt "0125 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'll...try..."
msgstr ""

#. あ…れ…？
msgctxt "0126 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "H...u...h...?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の…違うよね…？
msgctxt "0127 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Th-That totally wasn't normal, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. 攻略フラグとかそういうんじゃないよね…？
msgctxt "0128 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Did she just c-capture his flag...?"
msgstr ""

#. ダメよ！　ダメダメ！！
msgctxt "0129 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "No! No no no!"
msgstr ""

#. アタシと白夜様の恋路をジャマする人間が
#. 存在してはならないのよッ！
msgctxt "0130 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I cannot suffer the existence of someone who would\n"
"disturb the romance between me and Master!"
msgstr ""

#. な、何言ってんの！？　そんな訳ないじゃん！
msgctxt "0131 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Wh-What are you talking about!? That's absolutely NOT\n"
"what's happening here!"
msgstr ""

#. 誰が…あんな“かませメガネ”を…！
msgctxt "0132 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Why would I ever go for a sleazeball like him!"
msgstr ""

#. かませ…メガネ…？
msgctxt "0133 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Sleaze...ball?"
msgstr ""

#. かませメガネだから、
#. かませメガネって言ったんじゃん！
msgctxt "0134 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's right! I called you a sleazeball! Cuz you are!\n"
"Sleazeball!"
msgstr ""

#. どうやらお前は…廃棄処分にされたいらしいな…
msgctxt "0135 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Apparently you still have a death wish."
msgstr ""

#. また嫌味？　あんたって友達いないでしょ？
msgctxt "0136 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Ohh, more biting sarcasm? No wonder you don't have any\n"
"friends!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと！　白夜様と口げんかなんて羨ましい！
#. アタシも白夜様と罵倒合戦がしたいのにッ！
msgctxt "0137 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Hey! Stop fighting with Master! You're making me\n"
"jealous! *I* want the abuse give-and-take! ME!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱ、みんな…
#. そう簡単に…仲良くって訳にはいかないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0138 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess it's not so easy for everyone to act like\n"
"friends...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そりゃ、そうだよな……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0139 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, that's just how it is for now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こうして、大神さんの学級裁判を終えたボクらは、
#. 再び、希望ヶ峰学園へと戻った…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0140 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And so, Sakura's class trial came to an end, and we\n"
"returned to the world of Hope's Peak Academy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、これで話は終わらない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0141 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the story wasn't even close to over.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さらに時間は飛んで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0142 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Time kept marching on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>個室に帰り…
#. そして、夜になり……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0143 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We all went back to our rooms, and before long, night\n"
"snuck up on us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
